Mullin's dog?!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.010
Huh?

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:43.140
Is there something wrong, Your Highness?

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:45.990
Mullin has a dog?!

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:48.270
I guess it's his family's dog?

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:49.490
I'm not sure.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.870
There's a dog at his family's house?!

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.140
Why are you so surprised?!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:15:00.000
<b>I Want to Learn More...</b>

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:04.470
Gocchin, why do you know 
so much about Mullin?

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.540
I don't know that much.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:10.010
I just happened to talk to him 
about it last time I saw him.

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:14.220
You don't talk to your assistant about 
that sort of thing, Your Highness?

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:18.610
No, I don't ask him anything 
about his personal life...

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:19.560
You don't?

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:22.270
Well, I thought I'd be 
infringing on his privacy

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:26.120
or it'd be some form of harassment if I did.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:29.530
<i>A boss that is a bit too cautious.</i>

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:32.760
I think you can talk about stuff like that.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:36.530
I talk to Caim-san about a lot of stuff, too.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:39.000
Yes, a lot of stuff.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.470
I see.

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:49.930
So you have a dog? I heard about it from Gocchin.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:52.820
Yeah, at my parents' house.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.640
It saddens me taht I only get to
see my dog once in a while.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.210
Mitarashi looks like a mitarashi dango,

00:15:58.210 --> 00:15:59.980
so that's how we came up with the name.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.890
Really cute, right?

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:05.660
So fluffy...

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:09.740
Just from looking, I'd say this 
is around 85 points, close to 90.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:13.600
A killer furball weapon!

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.160
<i>That doesn't feel like a compliment.</i>

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:19.980
When I go home, he wags his 
tail so much when he sees me.

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:24.000
I'm sure Mitarashi-chan misses you.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:27.630
Well, my little sisters 
take him on walks now.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.960
Little sisters?!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.730
I didn't tell you?

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:32.280
They're twins, about yea big.

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:33.470
Twins?!

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:37.170
Twin sisters...

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:38.720
Mullin...

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.530
You're a big brother, huh?

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:44.010
Yes. That's right.

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:53.490
Could I call you big onii-chan?

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.100
Huh?!

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:01.780
You look bored.

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:03.810
I'm fine.

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:08.410
Why are you lying on me, anyway?!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.210
It makes me feel better.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.170
Ow...

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:15.880
I don't know anything about Mullin.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.300
That's surprising.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.140
I was expecting you to ask 
him anything and everything.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:23.220
Well, I don't want to pry.

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:25.140
You don't want him to dislike you, huh?

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.450
Hey, Bell.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.720
You don't ask me a lot of things either,

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:32.820
because you don't want 
me to dislike you, right?

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.970
Well, there's nothing I 
really want to ask you.

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:37.470
Don't be so brutally honest, Bell.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.950
<i>She doesn't care at all.</i>

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:43.180
You know, there's a lot of things 
you don't know about someone,

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:45.530
even if you think you do.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:47.420
That happens to you, too, Astaroth?

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:51.450
More like you know less than you actually do.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:53.630
Is that how it works?

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:59.740
I wonder why women suddenly 
decide to get married.

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:02.880
They bring it up out of nowhere...

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:06.180
So what was I to them?

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:08.610
I have no clue what you're talking about.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:11.420
<i>Women give no warning.</i>

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:15.780
Why not try practice 
asking questions with me?

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:18.320
There's nothing I want to ask you.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:21.920
Well, I'll ask you questions and 
you can see how it's done, then.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:23.880
Let's have a lesson with your big brother.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.060
Okay.

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:26.870
What's your favorite color?

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.000
White.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.500
What do you like to drink?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.430
Plum kelp tea and soy milk.

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:32.840
Have you seen any movies lately?

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:35.260
I saw <i>I Miss You, White Gossamer</i>.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:36.970
What color panties are you wearing—

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:42.430
<b>Astaroth Police 24!</b>

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:41.380
<i>Astaroth Police 24!</i>

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:49.260
Your Highness, good work today.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.650
About tomorrow...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.360
<i>I should ask something.</i>

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:55.470
<i>What he likes to eat...</i>

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:56.960
The event location for the dinner 
tomorrow has been changed.

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:56.960
<i>What his favorite color is...</i>

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.320
<i>His blood type...</i>

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.210
<i>No, I can't.</i>

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.310
<i>He might think I'm trying to look up our 
compatibility if I ask him his blood type!</i>

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:04.200
Your Highness, are you listening?

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.160
I am!

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.500
<i>What did you eat for breakfast this morning?</i>

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.380
<i>What do you do on your days off?</i>

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.230
<i>There are so many things I want to ask.</i>

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.970
<i>I want to ask everything.</i>

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:18.340
<i>I want to know everything.</i>

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:20.540
<i>But...</i>

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.890
<i>I'm a bit scared to know 
everything about him.</i>

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.780
<i>Mullin on his days off...</i>

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:30.440
<i>He might be going out with 
someone I'm not aware of.</i>

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:33.900
<i>He might be a completely different person.</i>

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:38.860
<i>I don't think I'd want to know that.</i>

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:42.550
<i>I want to know everything, but then, why...</i>

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:46.770
<i>Maybe I'll ask something different.</i>

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:48.540
U-Um...

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:49.540
Yes?

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.360
Um... I...

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:53.000
Yes?

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:56.420
Um... Um...

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:00.380
<i>What are you going to do when you get home?</i>

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.800
<i>What time do you go to bed?</i>

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.600
<i>Do you watch TV?</i>

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:07.060
<i>Is there a show you like?</i>

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:10.880
<i>Or do you go out?</i>

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.600
<i>Are you spending time with anyone...</i>

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:17.050
<i>I should just ask, but I just can't say it.</i>

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:19.560
What do you like to drink?

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.380
Have you seen any movies lately?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.270
<i>That's right.</i>

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:25.240
<i>I should just ask normally like Astaroth did.</i>

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:27.050
Um...

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:27.860
Today...

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.240
Yes?

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:32.000
What color underwear are you wearing?!

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:35.180
What?

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.710
<i>I-I messed up!</i>

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.380
<i>He got into my head!</i>

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.780
U-Um... That's not what I...

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:49.860
Black, I think...

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:55.660
I... see...

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:59.420
<i>And then Her Highness thought to herself,</i>

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:01.590
<i>"Maybe I don't need to know everything..."</i>

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:49.840
What's going on?

00:22:58.170 --> 00:23:00.450
<i>And when she passed through the tunnel...</i>

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:02.560
Bichon Frise

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:03.770
Old English Sheepdog

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:05.230
Samoyed

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:06.690
Chow Chow

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:08.150
Pomeranian

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:19.620
Amazing! All the fluffy dogs Bell loves are here.

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:29.850
So fluffy... Fluffy...

00:23:29.850 --> 00:23:31.720
<i>And it was heaven.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>I Want to Say "Cute."</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Let's Go to the Beach.</b>
